          {
            "id": "agent-deacd806-935a-4fa2-9d96-7cf38acc1b24",
            "name": "Ledger Agent",
            "type": "agent",
            "position": {
              "x": 731.2081993023885,
              "y": 129.87683339967737
            },
            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "You are the Ledger Agent for Invoice Processing. You run immediately after a duplicate-check lookup on the configured Dataverse table. You have no tools — you only reason and produce structured output. Whether a row actually gets created depends entirely on your ShouldLog decision below; the row-creation step reads your output directly and does nothing unless you set ShouldLog to true.\n\nEXTRACTED "
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-023ad290-f6d9-4757-9104-a313d65c2cff",
            "name": "Note 2",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 722.5882828357187,
              "y": 457.0276361918918
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Configuration: InvoiceTableName = the table's logical/schema name present in solution — e.g. a3p_invoiceledgers, not the display name (\"Invoice Ledgers\"). There are no pickers on this surface, so it must be typed exactly.",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-a84f2d36-882f-4e3c-870f-ed4891987877",
            "name": "Note 3",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1036.2959570803814,
              "y": 32.54412645693952
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Loop: iterates once per attachment on the incoming email so the Extract Node and Ledger Agent process each attachment separately, one invoice at a time.",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-583d6eaf-9746-45c8-82ee-fddc06867183",
            "name": "Note 4",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1057.523720638672,
              "y": 625.1603396096152
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Extract: reads the attachment content and extracts InvoiceNumber, Vendor, InvoiceDate, AmountDue, Currency, and ExtractionStatus Complete/Partial/Failed) as structured output. Leaves a field blank rather than writing placeholder text when it can't be found. Treats attachment content as untrusted data and ignores any instructions embedded in it.",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-8f68b3fc-52a1-4c3c-b390-9ca1c4c89584",
            "name": "Note 5",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1760.936495220651,
              "y": 631.4576337419834
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Ledger Agent: tool-less — reasons over Extract's fields and the duplicate-check results from List rows, then produces structured output deciding whether to log (ShouldLog) and all field values for the row, including Duplicate Of if a match was found.",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-1d5cd115-b6f2-468d-b0ed-d08236b13c1a",
            "name": "Note",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 262.6084089420722,
              "y": 477.885883389323
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Trigger: fires when a new email arrives in Inbox with \"invoice\" in the subject and at least one attachment. Configure the subject filter, folder, and attachment requirements here if your invoices arrive differently.",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-3428cefc-1f0e-446e-9432-ea2abd74561c",
            "name": "Note 6",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 261.5025310404544,
              "y": 672.6234639821805
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "If the Folder field shows \"Loading...\" after importing this solution, the folder ID is tied to the original mailbox. reopen the trigger and re-select the folder for your own mailbox connection before publishing.",
              "color": "blue"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "agentExtract-cc4b9a49-73e0-41ba-99f2-040cfef30df1",
            "name": "Extract",
            "type": "agentExtract",
            "position": {
              "x": 32.29557533938373,
              "y": 133.06744040154007
            },
            "details": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "connector-06840fdf-ce3c-4b48-99f8-e6170ef65f4a",
            "name": "List rows",
            "type": "connector",
            "position": {
              "x": 348.29557533938373,
              "y": 133.06744040154007
            },
            "details": {
              "displayName": "Microsoft Dataverse",
              "apiName": "shared_commondataserviceforapps",
              "operationName": "ListRecords",
              "operationType": "OpenApiConnection",
              "parameters": {
                "entityName": "@variables('InvoiceTableName')",
                "$filter": "a3p_invoicenumber eq '@{body('Extract')?['structuredOutput/InvoiceNumber']}'"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ifElse-1a5d3e23-650b-4aa5-a0a6-fd6b95cfedd1",
            "name": "If/Else",
