            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "If/Else: the only deterministic gate in this flow. Decides if we have to push the values to table or let it be. ",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-e7cc29e7-06ba-4232-9ae3-3d244d0a2616",
